<div
  style="
    font-family: sans-serif;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px;
  "
>
  <h2 style="color: #15803d">Payment Verified</h2>
  <p>Hi <strong><%= userName %></strong>,</p>
  <p>
    Great news! Your payment for the En-Passant Recruitment has been
    successfully verified.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can now view your
    <a href="<%= recruitmentDashboardUrl %>" style="color: #1e3a8a; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold;">recruitment dashboard</a>
    and proceed with your assigned recruitment tasks, once they are revealed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Your official payment receipt has been generated. You can download it using
    the link below:
  </p>
  <div style="margin: 30px 0">
    <a
      href="<%= receiptUrl %>"
      style="
        background-color: #1e3a8a;
        color: white;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-weight: bold;
        display: inline-block;
      "
      >Download Receipt</a
    >
  </div>
  <p style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #666">
    Recruitment Dashboard: <a href="<%= recruitmentDashboardUrl %>" style="color: #1e3a8a;"><%= recruitmentDashboardUrl %></a><br />
    Or copy receipt link: <a href="<%= receiptUrl %>" style="color: #1e3a8a;"><%= receiptUrl %></a>
  </p>
  <br />
  <p>Best regards,<br /><strong>En-Passant Team</strong></p>
</div>
